# Unit Canon (locked)

**Canonical:** `docs/RIMVIO_UNIT_CANON.md` · ADR-047 · `lib/unit-canon/`

> Every measured value = **value + unit + context + surface**.  
> Lodging **display** = nightly KRW · **Prepare/Commit** = stay total.

| Axis | Canon |
|------|-------|
| Time | ISO-8601 + IANA · nights from checkIn/Out |
| Money (card) | nightly + `/ 1박` |
| Money (pay) | `totalPriceKrw` |
| Space | meters store · walk minutes UI (`WALK_METERS_PER_MINUTE`) |
| Rating | ★ 0–5 · do not mix with Match% |
| Match | 0–100 · Decision weights sum to 1 |

## Do

- New money/date/distance formatters → `lib/unit-canon/` (or re-export)
- Keep `basis` on lodging prices (`nightly` \| `total`)

## PR reject

- Stay total labeled as `/ 1박` on cards
- Bare KRW without basis
- ★5 and Match% in one chip
- Helpers that bypass Unit Canon for lodging display money
